& \multicolumn{3}{@{}p{0.72\linewidth}@{}}{\hspace*{7\fontdimen2\font}$\forall \{A\ B\ C : \mathrm{Prop}\},\ (A \to B) \to (B \to C) \to A \to C$.} \\
